/_Q8m57JccJKHlH00.jpg", "mpeg": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2116836737565499393/pl/hph7w0t-dtTf0cYM.m3u8?v=825", "aspectRatio": [9, 16], "heightRatio": 177, "type": "video/mp4", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2116836737565499393/vid/avc1/320x568/UPAvrIYHs2PV4IFE.mp4"}, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2063337153795436544/51yxaD_K_normal.jpg", "displayName": "Brims", "username": "BrimsCr7"}, "content": "\ud83d\udea8 BREAKING: Poland\u2019s President has made his second Speech this morning amid the escalating political crisis engulfing the country.\n\nBelow is the video in which I spoke out against illegal immigration. Since then, I have faced attacks and criticism, but I refuse to be", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 16842}, "images": false, "linkEmbed": false, "replies": 440, "created": 1793539283000, "id": "2116883302866935915", "video": false, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1462165410061733892/Bqc8rSBE_normal.jpg", "displayName": "P\u0159evozn\u00edk\ud83c\udde8\ud83c\uddff\ud83c\uddf7\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\ud83c\uddf0", "username": "Pevoznk1"}, "content": "Aktu\u00e1ln\u011b \u203c\ufe0fDne\u0161n\u00ed projev Polsk\u00e9ho prezidenta k n\u00e1rodu ...\n\u0158\u00edk\u00e1 \u017ee str\u016fjce p\u0159evratu\nDonald Tusk bude zat\u010den a souzen podle Polsk\u00e9ho pr\u00e1va, nikoli podle pr\u00e1va EU.\nBravo p.Navrocki\ud83d\udc4f\ud83d\udc4f\ud83d\udc4f", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 29523}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1AToULPxpf", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 47, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8917107, "raw_content": "RealClearPolitics is a solid site to review polls and see the averaged out.\r\n\r\nhttps://www.realclearpolling.com/polls/senate/general/2026/texas/talarico-vs-paxton\r\n\r\nThe 10 polls released currently have Talarico leadion by 2.5 points, which is within the \"margin of error\".\r\n\r\nHere is my main philosophy. I reviewed each poll, and none have more than 1,250 participants. Most had 1,000 give or take.\r\n\r\nThat means all of this polling data that we use to impact our views is based on the responses of roughly 10,000k Texans.\r\n\r\nThis is laughable information. This 10k would not even be an acurate representation of another 10k people surveyed, because the polls themselves which each 1,000 fluctuate wildly.\r\n\r\nThere are to be an expected 10 million Texans voting in this election. 10k, the polls, make up 0.01% of the electorate.\r\n\r\nOne tenth or a percent. And who do we think is more or less likely to respond to polls?\r\n\r\nI've met conservatives who have no choice but to hide their views so much so that they won't register t O a party because it could destroy their occupation!\r\n\r\nMy entire point is that polling data is not slightly reliable. ", "author": "MagaJay02", "created": 1793627619228, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Tardigrade", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "A personal ascessment of why polling data is irrelevant in my eyes: Texas: Paxton VS Talarico ", "last_comment_created": 1793634344367, "content": "<p>RealClearPolitics is a solid site to review polls and see the averaged out.</p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.realclearpolling.com/polls/senate/general/2026/texas/talarico-vs-paxton\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.realclearpolling.com/polls/senate/general/2026/texas/talarico-vs-paxton</a></p>\n<p>The 10 polls released currently have Talarico leadion by 2.5 points, which is within the &quot;margin of error&quot;.</p>\n<p>Here is my main philosophy. I reviewed each poll, and none have more than 1,250 participants. Most had 1,000 give or take.</p>\n<p>That means all of this polling data that we use to impact our views is based on the responses of roughly 10,000k Texans.</p>\n<p>This is laughable information. This 10k would not even be an acurate representation of another 10k people surveyed, because the polls themselves which each 1,000 fluctuate wildly.</p>\n<p>There are to be an expected 10 million Texans voting in this election. 10k, the polls, make up 0.01% of the electorate.</p>\n<p>One tenth or a percent. And who do we think is more or less likely to respond to polls?</p>\n<p>I've met conservatives who have no choice but to hide their views so much so that they won't register t O a party because it could destroy their occupation!</p>\n<p>My entire point is that polling data is not slightly reliable.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 13, "score_up": 47, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2117255392124428698", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToULPyIb", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 40, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8917179, "raw_content": "", "author": "Belleoffreedom", "created": 1793630720112, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Belleoffreedom", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1AToULPyIb.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/DataRepublican/status/2117255392124428698", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": fa